229AM c  2015De22: {+229}Am produced in multinucleon transfer reaction          
229AM2c  {+248}Cm({+48}Ca,X),E({+48}Ca)=270 MeV at the UNILAC facility at GSI.  
229AM3c  Target=460 |mg/cm{+2} thick {+248}Cm oxide deposited on Ti backing.    
229AM4c  The velocity filter SHIP was used to separate target-like reaction     
229AM5c  products which were implanted on a position sensitive silicon strip    
229AM6c  detector (PSSD). A box of six Si detectors surrounded the PSSD to      
